# Keep line endings identical in the repository and in the working copy.
# Every file here is text and LF-safe, and npm publishes from the working copy,
# so a checkout that silently rewrote line endings would publish different bytes
# than the ones reviewed. CI runs on Linux and the plugin also runs on Windows,
# which is exactly where an unnoticed CRLF/LF rewrite would bite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows command shims must stay CRLF if any are ever added.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary fixtures a test or a future asset may add.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tgz binary
